      "mergeID": "661d41f327461cd43190c244",
      "mergedPostDetails": "World in question:\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_0efac254-51e3-40cf-b77e-df64edbcf110\n\n1. Opt into Beta\n\n2. Try to go to world\n\n3. Loading gets stuck at Initializing World. VRChat stops responding\n\n4. After a couple of minutes get an error popup saying that I was disconnected due to VRChat not responding. \n\n5. Clicking the Okay button or waiting for a short time will put me back into loading the world. Steps 3-5 will repeat until VRChat is closed.\n\nLoading the World seems to work fine on live.\n\nNot entirely sure what's causing it. Thought it might be the camera fixes somehow since the world is rather large and has a distant far clip plane. But I tested other maps with distant far clip planes like Test Pilots and those work fine on the Beta.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1442] Hang/Infinite Load loop on World Load for specific world on beta, works fine on live.",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "661a9488395cce4f5a0d279d",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As far as I aware, root of issue be 22f1 engine use more resource than 4f1 cause handle failed. (so too heavy perf visual and/or UDON which require optimisation)\n\n(There maybe change it got fixed on later version of unity but not at this time as far as I see on release note)\n\nBut not sent to home world is actually issue which require to fix.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
